            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "MER-PR-web-becoming-a-merrill-lynch-advisor#1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Merrill saw client sales of alternative investments increase 19% in the third quarter of 2026, and the firm will continue to invest in AI and digital capabilities.",
            "quote": "At Merrill Lynch, client sales of alternative investments increased 19% in the quarter, said Eric Schimpf, president and co-head of Merrill Wealth Management... the message was clear that the firm would continue to invest in AI and digital capabilities.",
